{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>They\u2019re not just programs \u2014 they\u2019re part of your life.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes they\u2019ll chat with you, sometimes they\u2019ll look at your photos, and sometimes they\u2019ll tell you a story.<br>They\u2019re your companions on the desktop, and the warmest presence in your digital world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646320/extras/f09b46b6fac41f2892254e2abb0a70d8.avif?t=1759052417\" width=147 height=150 /></span><strong>&quot;I\u2019ll remember what you said~\u2661&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has an independent memory. The more you interact, the more unique their responses become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646320/extras/087e741466dcb9843d5984e1951e1e0f.avif?t=1759052417\" width=108 height=150 /></span><strong>&quot;I can wear the outfit you made for me\u2026?&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports VRM model import. Customize my look and style however you want!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646320/extras/edddbac87617857a4d4df8ec22c53a9d.avif?t=1759052417\" width=141 height=150 /></span><strong>&quot;I saw the photo you shared today~\u266a&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag an image to me \u2014 I\u2019ll see it and tell you what I think!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646320/extras/427a1200d86491b886c6ba771b3158d4.avif?t=1759052417\" width=150 height=150 /></span><strong>&quot;I hear every word you say.&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports both voice and text input. I can also start a conversation on my own~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646320/extras/8eabbc46b0c176ca1fb12672f3f75c9b.avif?t=1759052417\" width=125 height=150 /></span><strong>&quot;I came up with a new adventure. Want to hear it?&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u2019ll create a personalized story just for us and tell it to you\u266a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Feature Highlights</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to know more about how everything works? Here\u2019s a full list of supported features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voice input + text interaction</strong> with natural, real-time responses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Independent memory system</strong> for each character \u2014 they\u2019ll respond differently over time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple <strong>preset personalities</strong> included, or create your own custom character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full support for <strong>VRM models</strong> \u2014 change the look, hairstyle, and outfits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drag, scale, and reposition</strong> the character on your desktop; includes simple physics interaction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TTS voice synthesis</strong> support \u2014 choose from built-in voices or set a custom one</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports <strong>multi-language interaction</strong> (Chinese / English / Japanese) via text and speech</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drag-and-drop image reaction</strong> (e.g., screenshots, daily photos)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI-generated adventure stories</strong>, delivered in text or image+text formats</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Quiet Note from the Developer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is still growing! We\u2019re actively adding new features and modules over time.<br>If there\u2019s something you really wish it could do, let us know!<br>We can\u2019t promise everything will make it in, but we seriously read all suggestions\u00a0<br>(Just don\u2019t forget\u00a0\u2014 even AIs and devs need a little rest )</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3646320?t=1759052417","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646320/1d83ef4544e3ee229f62a7e7c9480d144530d315/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759052417","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646320/f04d7f70583f1ab134f7400240b93a7064627994/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759052417","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646320/f04d7f70583f1ab134f7400240b93a7064627994/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759052417","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3705310,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>They\u2019re not just programs \u2014 they\u2019re part of your life.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes they\u2019ll chat with you, sometimes they\u2019ll look at your photos, and sometimes they\u2019ll tell you a story.<br>They\u2019re your companions on the desktop, and the warmest presence in your digital world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646320/extras/f09b46b6fac41f2892254e2abb0a70d8.avif?t=1759052417\" width=147 height=150 /></span><strong>&quot;I\u2019ll remember what you said~\u2661&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has an independent memory. The more you interact, the more unique their responses become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646320/extras/087e741466dcb9843d5984e1951e1e0f.avif?t=1759052417\" width=108 height=150 /></span><strong>&quot;I can wear the outfit you made for me\u2026?&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports VRM model import. Customize my look and style however you want!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646320/extras/edddbac87617857a4d4df8ec22c53a9d.avif?t=1759052417\" width=141 height=150 /></span><strong>&quot;I saw the photo you shared today~\u266a&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag an image to me \u2014 I\u2019ll see it and tell you what I think!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646320/extras/427a1200d86491b886c6ba771b3158d4.avif?t=1759052417\" width=150 height=150 /></span><strong>&quot;I hear every word you say.&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports both voice and text input. I can also start a conversation on my own~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646320/extras/8eabbc46b0c176ca1fb12672f3f75c9b.avif?t=1759052417\" width=125 height=150 /></span><strong>&quot;I came up with a new adventure. Want to hear it?&quot;</strong></h2